              {
                "end": 571,
                "rank": 1,
                "text": "# Harbor Night Restore R-17: signed result table\nDocument status: signed final; all attempted restores counted.\nSynthetic local data only. Both candidates used the same nightly archive workload and checksum verification rule.\nQuill: median restore latency 150 seconds; successful restores 198; attempted restores 200.\nSable: median restore latency 149 seconds; successful restores 395; attempted restores 400.\nThe accepted denominator includes every attempted restore; no failed attempt may be dropped. No power-failure restore-time measurement is included in this table.",
                "score": 5.9436427307,
                "start": 0,
                "title": "02-r17-signed-results.md",
                "source": "synthetic:harbor/02-r17-signed-results.md",
                "chunk_id": "chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9",
                "bm25_score": 5.9436427307,
                "dense_score": null,
                "document_id": "harbor-2",
                "content_sha256": "d86faf3d5b0274333e72f932ef0c07f6b92e4e425b7e0885c3793787a34ba97c"
              },
              {
                "end": 719,
                "rank": 2,
                "text": "# Harbor archive: Night Restore R-17 acceptance rule\nDocument status: approved. Scope: Night Restore R-17 only.\nThis is an invented archive and invented equipment in a synthetic local evaluation. Nothing here is a public-source fact, operational incident, or production benchmark.\nR-17 acceptance requires BOTH: median restore latency strictly below 150 seconds, and successful restores divided by attempted restores of at least 99 percent. A median of exactly 150 seconds fails. Compare the unrounded success fraction against the threshold; a display rounded to 99 percent does not prove compliance.\nThese conditions apply to the recorded nightly restore workload. They do not establish behavior during power failures.",
                "score": 3.8004090109,
                "start": 0,
                "title": "01-night-restore-rule.md",
                "source": "synthetic:harbor/01-night-restore-rule.md",
                "chunk_id": "chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738",
