              {
                "end": 567,
                "rank": 4,
                "text": "# Harbor Archive Restore R-09: archived results\nDocument status: historical record for a separate earlier workload.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nR-09 tested an earlier firmware version with a smaller archive. Quill had a median restore latency of 142 seconds and 200 successful restores out of 200 attempts. Sable had a median of 140 seconds and 400 successful restores out of 400 attempts. Both met the R-09 acceptance requirements.\nR-09 does not describe the later Night Restore R-17 workload and cannot replace its signed measurements or its acceptance decision.",
